Node ID=650 collect gears
Text=So, he's too afraid to deal with me so he sends his apprentice? Very well, I'll make the gears, if you can provide me with a magical potion - any potion will do - so that I can create enchanted steam.   It's the last thing I need to make the gears the old man wants.
