Node ID=655 machine talks
Text=The old man didn't tell you about me? <The machine hisses loudly> He *never* gives credit where credit is due. *I* am the brains behind this operation. I've helped him build all of his inventions, but what thanks do I receive? Just more work, and the occasional lubing, though that is nice.
Should Have Voiceover=0

