Node ID=700 Fixt the turret gear
Text=Forty-one. <The machine's hissing drops to something almost thoughtful> He has finally drawn the turret ring, then. That is not a gear, apprentice, that is the whole argument - one tooth out of true and the housing tears itself off the carriage the first time it fires. I can cut it. I am the only thing in this city that can cut it. But the big one costs more than a flask of steam does, so let us discuss what you are bringing me.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=DaVinci Have a Potion for machine
Reply Text=A potion, the same as last time. Take it and cut the gear.
Go to node ID=705 Fixt the gear is cut
Custom Action=CActionRemoveInventoryItem
{
Who to remove from=$instigator
Inventory Item To remove=Inventory Items/Potion
}
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Barter moreequal 35
Reply Text=You will cut it for nothing, because you have spent ten minutes telling me you are the only thing in Barcelona that can, and a thing that rare does not haggle.
Go to node ID=704 Fixt out-argued
Icon=Speach Skill Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have nothing to pay you with. But I will tell him - to his face - that the machine built it.
Go to node ID=702 Fixt the bargain
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will come back when I have something worth your steam.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1

