Node ID=706 Fixt the debt unpaid
Text=I cut it. You carried it up the stairs and he put his hands on it and I have not heard one word since. <The hissing is perfectly level.> He is in this room most evenings, apprentice. I am not asking you to write it on the cathedral. One sentence, where I can hear it. Until then I have nothing to say to you that is not this.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You will hear it.
